| WP root | `/home/server-manager/www/arrayhash/mirror-help.arrayhash.com/public` |
| Plugin workspace | `<WP root>/wp-content/plugins` |
| Site timezone | `gmt_offset = +6` (UTC+6), `timezone_string` empty |
