+# SLT-MYA-02 D05 evening renewal reconciliation
+
+Captured 2026-08-07 during the 19:10 site-time phase.
+
+## Temporal limitation
+
+The authored final-five-minute charge baselines were not captured by the earlier phase and cannot be reconstructed:
+
+- Target 12655 / action 15254: required baseline window 17:14:21-17:19:20 site; action completed via WP Cron at 17:20:25.
+- Control 12234 / action 15267: required baseline window 17:38:36-17:43:35 site; action completed via WP Cron at 17:44:12.
+
+The owner-boundary requirement is therefore UNVERIFIED. No action was forced and no later action is being used as a substitute.
+
+## Persisted target renewal proof
+
+- Subscription 12655, product 12577, parent order 12654, user 347.
+- Natural action 15254 completed via WP Cron.
+- Relationship-exact renewal order 13047: completed, $9.00, Stripe, cycle 3, scheduled `2026-08-07 10:44:10` UTC, both relationship metas equal 12655.
+- Order source fields equal the new provider payment method `pm_1U1dWhJG5OzSNVs2QhWrz7vj`.
+- Token 31 maps that source to Mastercard ending 4444 and remains the account default.
+- Subscription advanced to three completed payments and `2026-08-08 10:44:10` UTC.
+- Mailpit: `0mcQC5tfTKYwBhjzMn66pT` admin New order #13047; `5CB3n5XA76PpXYKGnPuChQ` customer Payment received for subscription #12655.
+- Browser evidence: `/home/server-manager/slt-evidence/SLT-MYA-02-04-renewal-order-meta.png`.
+
+## Persisted control renewal proof
+
+- Subscription 12234, product 12087, parent order 12233, user 347.
+- Natural action 15267 completed via WP Cron.
+- Relationship-exact renewal order 13050: completed, $20.00, Stripe, cycle 5, scheduled `2026-08-07 07:50:13` UTC, both relationship metas equal 12234.
+- Order source fields equal the old provider payment method `pm_1TzyfSJG5OzSNVs21dxjlcMi`.
+- Token 17 maps that source to Visa ending 4242 and is not the account default.
+- Subscription advanced to five completed payments and `2026-08-08 07:50:13` UTC.
+- Mailpit: `52iBJa6IqDmQB7WegnsEAA` admin New order #13050; `7YBWKCgFiOa2WULju9KRMJ` customer Payment received for subscription #12234.
+- Browser evidence: `/home/server-manager/slt-evidence/SLT-MYA-02-04b-control-renewal-order.png`.
+
+No target/control renewal order carries `_stripe_card_brand`; each order's exact source ID is linked to the named saved token and the subscription/card evidence. This order-meta field is recorded as absent rather than fabricated.
+
+## Cross-subscription regression discovered later in the phase
+
+The morning after-state proved subscription 12655 alone held Mastercard 4444 / the new provider payment method. Order 13047 proves its 17:20 natural renewal charged that new source. At 19:33, authenticated manual payment of relationship-exact order 13063 for different subscription 11959 selected the old saved Visa 4242. Immediately afterward:
+
+- order 13063 remained linked only to subscription 11959 and recorded the old source;
+- account token 31 / Mastercard 4444 remained default;
+- subscription 12655 unexpectedly reverted to the old provider payment method, brand Visa, last4 4242;
+- `_payment_method_updated_at` on 12655 remained stale at the original 08:28:56 setup time and no new payment-method note was added.
+
+This temporal attribution is an inference from the exact persisted before/order/after evidence; no other action for subscription 12655 occurred between its successful 17:20 renewal and the 19:33 manual payment. Finding: `issues/SLT-EML-02-manual-payment-updates-wrong-subscription.md`.
+
+## Future gate
+
+Keep card 85 in progress. The authored final read/review is due at the first D06 phase, 2026-08-08 06:10 site, before its next invoice actions. Preserve the regression state; do not reset tokens or subscription meta.
