+# SLT-EML-02 D05 evening payment and handoff
+
+Captured on 2026-08-07 between 19:16 and 19:35 site time (UTC+6).
+
+## Natural invoice leg
+
+- Subscription: 11959 (`slt-core@example.test`, user 347, customer role)
+- Product: 11927, `SLT Daily Core`
+- Invoice action: 15327, completed naturally via WP Cron at 15:38:07 site
+- Invoice mail: `62R3k1if4aveVTY6lkh2K5`, customer only
+- Relationship-exact renewal order: 13063, cycle 6, scheduled date `2026-08-07 12:39:05` UTC
+- Invoice guard: `_arraysubs_renewal_invoice_email_sent=yes`
+- Content: subscription 11959, product SLT Daily Core, amount $10.00, due `7 August, 2026 6:39 PM (UTC+6)`
+- Pay URL returned HTTP 200 and displayed a payable $10.00 Stripe order.
+
+## Restore/recovery proof
+
+- Exact pre-task `_auto_renew` state: absent.
+- A prior D05 phase accidentally used `wp post meta delete 11959 _auto_renew --all`, which removed all 47 subscription-meta rows at 16:03:13 site.
+- That phase transactionally restored the 46 original binlog row images at 16:08:03 site and left only the temporary `_auto_renew=off` row absent.
+- The evening pre-payment read independently confirmed: 46 recovered original rows/anchors present, `_auto_renew` absent with zero rows, subscription active, order 13063 pending, and charge action 15328 still pending.
+- No meta delete or re-arm was performed in the evening phase.
+
+## Browser payment
+
+- Session: `customer-SLT-EML-02-pay2` (closed after capture)
+- The hosted new-card iframe was present but the browser driver could not select the cross-origin frame. The already-tokenized Stripe test Visa ending 4242 was selected on the exact order-pay page; no full card number was entered, printed, persisted, or captured.
+- `PAY_PRE=6sMnHvedpurd7IzTyDTU2D`, captured at 19:33:39 site immediately before submit.
+- Receipt evidence: `/home/server-manager/slt-evidence/SLT-EML-02-04-order-paid.png`
+- Browser result: `Order completed`; no browser errors. Console contained only WooCommerce dependency-info and jQuery Migrate informational messages.
+- Complete attributable Mailpit delta after `PAY_PRE`:
+  - `61uMOBgJpO2BBvu9HMUHyw` — admin New order `#13063`
+  - `5hm1LQfe2IKo0vIamcv9kd` — customer `Payment received for subscription #11959`
+- No customer WooCommerce order mail appeared in the complete delta.
+
+## Post-payment state
+
+- Order 13063: completed, $10.00, Stripe, customer 347, relationship fields both 11959, cycle 6, scheduled date `2026-08-07 12:39:05`, invoice guard `yes`.
+- Subscription 11959: active, completed payments 5 to 6, next payment exactly `2026-08-08 12:39:05` UTC, pending order cleared, last payment `2026-08-07 13:33:56` UTC.
+- `_auto_renew`: still absent, zero rows.
+- Old charge action 15328: canceled without an attempt.
+- Next invoice action: 15676, pending for `2026-08-08 09:37:52` UTC / 15:37:52 site.
+- Next charge action: 15677, pending for `2026-08-08 15:37:52` UTC / 21:37:52 site.
+- `POST_RESTORE_MAIL_BASE=5hm1LQfe2IKo0vIamcv9kd`.
+
+## Future gate
+
+Keep card 67 in progress. At the D06 16:10 site phase, after action 15676 has passed, prove that no `Invoice for subscription #11959` exists after `POST_RESTORE_MAIL_BASE`, classify the complete unrelated delta, then self-review and move the card through review to done.
