- Paying order `13063` for subscription `11959` with saved Visa `4242` unexpectedly reverted unrelated subscription `12655` from Mastercard `4444` to Visa `4242` while account token `31` remained default. The current state was preserved without a repair mutation and the high-severity standalone issue is `issues/SLT-EML-02-manual-payment-updates-wrong-subscription.md`.
