- `SLT-CHK-12` and `SLT-SYN-12` were not partially started because their authored 90-minute/two-hour legs could not safely complete before the `21:32` runner-release cutoff. `SLT-LIFE-03` was left for the `21:42` phase so its settings bracket can complete with the mandatory restoration reserve. No global settings bracket was opened in this evening phase.

